      en: ["Komsomolsk-on-Amur was founded on May 10, 1932, by youth volunteers.", "It is the main manufacturing site for the Sukhoi Su-57 stealth fighter.", "The Amur River at this point is approximately 2.5 kilometers wide.", "The city is located 356 kilometers north of Khabarovsk by rail.", "It serves as a vital junction on the Baikal-Amur Mainline (BAM) railway.", "The city is home to the largest oil refinery in the Russian Far East."],
