      en: ["Founded on September 12, 1838, on the site of Sujuk-Qale fortress.", "Awarded the title of Hero City on September 14, 1973.", "The port handles over 140 million tons of cargo annually.", "Current population is approximately 262,000 residents.", "Main terminal for the Baku-Novorossiysk oil pipeline.", "Wind speeds during bora events have been recorded up to 190 km/h."],
